WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.830
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.770
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.840
I can say love

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.570
will you love me?

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.610
That's Jurai's capital, the Heaven's Tree-the largest tree in the universe.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.970
Amazing!

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.030
Welcome.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:03.960
Seina Yamada-dono. Seto-sama awaits.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.900
Wait for us, Ryoko-sama!

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:18.480
What are you doing?!

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.110
Outta the way before Ryoko-sama gets away!

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.980
You boys come this way.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.290
Right this way, please.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.290
Finally...!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.560
What we've been waiting for...!

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.260
The erotic welcome party...!

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.590
This way!

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:31.930
Coming!

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.460
I dunno, could be a trap...

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:35.860
Hey there, what's wrong?

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:39.700
I-I'm coming! Even though I know it could be a trap!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.940
An erotic reception means that we'd at least get 2 girls apiece, right?

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:47.070
I'd prefer a short one in a sailor uniform and one with blonde hair!

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:50.810
I'd like one in a yukata pretending to be married, and another in a Chinese dress!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:51.610
What about you, Cohen?

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:54.270
I want one who will call me, Big Brother!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.250
Go on in!

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.900
So you're the new assigned officers?!

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.830
We're leaving at once!

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:16.960
On Jurai

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.140
Forgive me!

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.880
Under normal circumstances I would have prepared a state banquet,

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.640
so although meager, please enjoy the food!

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.090
This is meager...?

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:36.020
Excellent work. I thank you again!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.290
No, it wasn't that much...

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.730
There's no need for embarrassment.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.430
Your work was quite an accomplishment!

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.070
Wasn't it, Amane-chan?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.800
Yeah...

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.440
So anyway, Amane-chan...

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.200
I think this man might be the one for you...

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.440
His age is the same as yours.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.710
It says here that he's the 2nd son of a kimono shop owner,

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.680
and that he loves talking to little birds!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.850
Seto-sama...

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.950
I'm sure he's a very nice gentleman,

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.350
but I'm in the middle of training Captain Seina!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:07.450
But Amane-san! That has nothing to do with it!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.580
If you're interested in him then I think you should date him right away!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.130
Mind your own business...!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.260
Oh, do you think so too, Ryoko-san?!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.000
Yes!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.690
Then might this person be a good match for your own life partner?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:25.310
I swore that I would serve Seina-dono for the rest of my life, so...!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:27.870
Nobody will mind if you don't stick to your promise. Right, Seina?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.580
Eh? Y-yeah...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.280
See! Even Seina's telling you to hurry up and get married!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:37.550
No fighting. I'll make sure to find someone for you both!

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.820
Ryoko-san should go first!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.620
No, Amane should go first!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.620
So then you would prefer going together!

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.060
Say, what about Kiriko?

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.490
That's right!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.160
Kiriko-san's so serious that I never hear any such rumors about her!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.500
But she's gone...

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.630
That darn Kiriko...!

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:56.140
Okay then! Let's talk over the details here!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.770
Stop! Let me go!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.910
Seina-sama...!

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.910
Seina-sama! I hear you were wonderful!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.910
Please tell us all about your heroic deeds!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.010
Eh? Alright...

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.450
Say, Seina-sama...

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.650
Allow me to serve you tonight...

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.250
No! Let me!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.920
Um... What do you mean by serve...?

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.690
Don't pretend you don't know...

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:16.920
We spend all night together...

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.730
What are you doing?!

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.700
Oh, Kiriko! I didn't see you there...

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.030
Seina-chan is only 15!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.910
More importantly... behind you...

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.740
Behind me...?

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:37.470
Perfect timing! Let us set you up with a suitor too!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.750
No...! I don't...!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.180
Don't be bothering Seina-chan!

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:44.810
Bye, Seto-sama...

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.170
What now?!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.300
Don't look so scared.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:06.740
I thought you might be wondering what is inside this box...

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.980
This is a royal tree seed?

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:12.980
Yes.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:16.650
The pirates apparently referred to it as the Original J.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:21.560
It was lost thousands of years ago when a royal ship was destroyed.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.590
It drifted through space this whole time,

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:27.460
and only recently did we learn that the pirates had discovered it,

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.330
but trying to get it back might have triggered an all-out war,

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.930
which is why we couldn't do anything about it until now.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.870
I see.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.170
That would explain why the pirates never stopped chasing us.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:39.270
Is it that great of a seed?

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.610
As a 3rd generation tree, it could keep a warship the size of a solar system

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.880
in constant battle mode.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.380
A solar system?!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.950
This little plum seed thingy...?

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.080
Seina-chan...

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:55.060
It was Ryoko-dono's colleagues who retrieved it for us.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.290
I am honored that you would mention that.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:01.430
But why was I made to dress up like this?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:04.760
First of all, this crest belonged to the commander of the Balouta Guild,

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.000
which died out long ago.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.100
Although you wish to give it to me, I cannot possibly accept it.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.570
You underwent body enhancement when you were born, correct?

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.570
Yes...

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:18.110
When you underwent it, a protection was placed in your genes.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:21.450
The genetic data the GP took from you the other day -

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:25.790
- With the protection removed... is this!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.590
And this is Commander Balouta's genetic data.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.890
Commander Balouta's genetic data?

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.930
There are many pirates who possess the Balouta name.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:40.470
But nearly all are because their ancestors were once members of the guild.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.340
Did you know that?

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:43.270
No idea.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.800
But you are different!

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.610
You are a true successor to the Balouta name!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.740
I'm Commander Balouta's...

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.580
Technically speaking, you are his great-granddaughter.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:56.180
And one other thing, the Balouta have not died out!

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:58.180
There is autonomous state in Juraian territory

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:00.720
that is currently governed by Commander Balouta.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.060
If recognized at the next Galactic Union meeting,

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.920
it can become an official, independent country!

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:09.060
So that means she's successor to the throne?!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.220
No way! She's a princess?!

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:16.640
Ah, Seto-sama, it's always a pleasure to see you.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.870
It is good to see you again, King!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.250
What a delight this is...

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.210
Um, Seto-sama...

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:30.520
Former Commander Balouta, and future king of Balouta...

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:33.950
...your great-grandfather.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.480
Something like that!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.860
...What... ...is this...?

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:42.460
Your eyes and your behavior... you're almost exactly like her!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.430
I'm so glad to meet you, Ryoko-chan!

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:49.800
I thought I was all alone after my parents died...

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.900
But I had no idea that...

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:54.970
The reason for that likely has to do with what I am about to tell you.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.080
Ryoko-dono.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.710
We are thinking of announcing you

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.310
when the kingdom gains its independence.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.650
If we convert people who are disloyal to the Balouta family or Da Ruma,

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:08.720
or pirates who want to quit, we can weaken the Da Ruma guild's power!

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.230
I'm already having them build your room in the palace!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.060
Your hotel arrangements are already underway,

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.430
and I have the band practicing for your welcome parade!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:20.900
So you can come today if you want!

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.500
Oh, pardon me! You must have your own circumstances too!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.910
Today, tomorrow, whenever... Come anytime you want!

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.440
Please stop, Ryoko-san!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.710
What are you doing?!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.720
I'm truly sorry, Great-Grandfather... no, Your Majesty!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:43.160
I have devoted my entire life to serving Seina-dono, who rescued me!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:47.030
So I cannot go to your kingdom!

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:51.460
My entire life is not a phrase one can say easily!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:56.200
You are aware of what meaning your actions have, correct?!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.260
I will serve Seina-dono for my entire life!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.610
Airi won't like this.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.210
So there you have it.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:07.980
I guess a strong sense of duty just doesn't pass down to descendants...

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:10.080
If that's your decision, then there's nothing I can do.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:14.450
So then why don't you become king and live with her here, Seina-dono?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.990
No!

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.630
Why Seto-sama too...?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.790
But this is a problem.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:23.160
If I don't come up with something soon the celebration will be a big waste...

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:27.900
You're still young, Great-Grandfather, so why not have another successor?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:30.900
A brother or sister for my grandmother!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.240
Ah, that's true!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.740
I'm still young and not all that unattractive!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.910
I still could if I wanted to!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.280
Say, are you unmarried?

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.250
Get lost!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:45.590
Ouch! You didn't need to hit me!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:50.290
Great-Grandfather. Is it really all right for me to accept this dress?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.390
Yes.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.990
Even though you're giving up the succession,

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.800
that doesn't change the fact that you're my great-granddaughter.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.870
Nor the fact that you're the princess of Balouta.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.800
It looks good on you.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.700
Come and visit anytime.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:05.810
I'll keep the band constantly practicing until then.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.840
Thank you, Great-Grandfather.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.740
Please stay in good health.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:15.280
Seina-dono. Take good care of Ryoko.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.950
R-right...

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.280
Well then...!

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.420
Was that really a good idea?

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:26.230
His Majesty looked troubled, you know...

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:27.660
What about you, Amane-san?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.500
Your parents seemed quite troubled because they really want a son-in-law

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.070
who they can pass Kaunaq on to!

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:38.340
Seina-dono. It sounds like the ship's repairs will take a long time.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.770
If you'd like, why not spend your time relaxing here for a little while?

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:45.450
Well, I'd love to, but I'm in the middle of training...

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.750
That's OK, I've gotten permission for you.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.480
Seto-sama...

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.020
Why am I always getting this much work...?

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:58.790
Seto-sama's no fair, she's always having fun with Seina-kun...

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.320
Oh, my! I might actually be good at this!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.280
I feel like I've become an ant...

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.690
Amazing!

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:43.770
Seina Yamada-dono.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.370
You are Seina Yamada-dono, are you not?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.740
T-that's right...

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.340
I'm Seina Yamada.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:53.210
You must have had a difficult time. I truly thank you.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.610
No, it wasn't all that...

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.620
It's just my job...

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:59.750
I realize how problematic it must have been.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:03.460
Well, just humor me and consider it a mishap.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:04.890
U-um...

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:08.700
As a result, both Azusa-sama and I can devote ourselves to our work now.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.130
She's been constantly running us ragged for these past 800 years.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.430
Um, who might you be?

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.870
Oh! How rude of me!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.270
I am Utsutsumi Kamiki.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.640
I am Seto's spouse.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.740
Seto-sama's...?!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.050
Forgive me. It is never a good idea to go against Seto's wishes.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:30.880
Acting defiantly only succeeds in delighting her.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.090
Sightseeing, are you?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:34.820
Allow me to show you around.

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.290
First, the famous sights of Jurai.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.090
U-um...!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:39.760
Is something the matter?

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.860
No, it's just that I'm worried about the Kamidake... the ship I was on...

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.300
Then let us go and see it.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.440
I will show you the way.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.840
Thanks...

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.340
Utsutsumi-sama and Seina-sama...

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.910
Please leave that area immediately.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.180
Is something the matter here?

00:13:58.180 --> 00:14:01.680
Misaki-sama dug a large hole around there the other day

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:04.950
and it has yet to be filled back in...

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.320
I tried to warn him of the danger, but...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:10.020
His luck is as poor as the stories say.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.170
Excuse me! What condition is it in?!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.070
Does it look like it will take a while?

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:30.610
Repairs are impossible.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.750
The parts you can see are obviously greatly damaged,

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:37.250
but the part you can consider the keel has also been severely warped.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.450
Had it been an ordinary ship,

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.290
it would have been destroyed long before Ryoko-dono arrived to help...

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:44.420
So then that means it's...

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:48.420
It means it will be decommissioned.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:56.340
You worked really hard. Thanks for everything.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.930
You're welcome!

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:02.810
That couldn't have been real...

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.670
What couldn't have been real?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.550
Who are you...?!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.920
I'm Neige.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:15.860
Neige...?

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:17.260
What's your name?

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:20.160
I'm Seina Yamada.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:23.130
You were talking with this ship, weren't you, Big Brother Seina?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.300
Uh, well...

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:29.600
This ship is saying, Thank you, to you too!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:34.360
Wait!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.640
Who was that girl?

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.420
This feels great!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:52.960
Eating food, taking a bath... it feels like a perfect hot spring vacation!

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:57.000
There's really no time for baths when you're on a ship, is there?

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.970
This is an amazing hot spring!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.900
You wouldn't think that you're inside a tree!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:03.640
The people here are screwed up, though...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.470
Such wonderful water...

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:07.740
Are you getting out already?

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:11.800
Sorry. But I need to go scrub Seina-sama's back...

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.210
Hold on there! I'll do it!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:19.320
That's okay! It is my job as Seina-sama's servant!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.850
Who says?!

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:22.390
I do!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:25.630
Stop, Amane! Besides, Seina-chan's in the men's hot spring!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.390
Which is why I must go to him...

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:30.200
That's not what I mean...!

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.530
There's no need for you to go!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:36.200
I know the most about scrubbing his back!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:39.210
I don't remember back-scrubbing being in his curriculum!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.610
Well I just added it!

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:44.480
Then go through proper procedures and get permission from Airi-sama!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.610
The current circumstances require quick decision-making!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:53.290
Stop that, you two! Don't you have any sense of shame?!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:57.420
What are you doing?!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.590
Why not draw lots?

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.720
Draw lots?

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.820
Why are there 4 sticks?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.990
OK, let's get this over with.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.180
OK, that was a practice draw.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.110
Now for the real one!

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:26.720
Come on, you two...

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.590
No hard feelings this time!

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.180
Here we go!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.730
OK, practice draw number 2 is over!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:42.600
The next one is really the real one!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:45.040
"Men's Hot Spring"

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.410
I finally feel like myself again...

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:52.210
Seina-dono...

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:57.820
Seto-sama...! This is the men's hot spring!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.510
I know.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.490
That's the end of practice draw number 37!

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:08.290
I thought I would come and scrub your back...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.600
I can scrub it by myself.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:13.360
Then could you scrub mine?

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:18.670
Best out of 200!

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.770
Are you dissatisfied with me?!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.610
That's not what I mean...

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:23.940
I see...

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.430
In that case...

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:33.050
Now there is nothing to complain about, is there?

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:35.620
Alright, I'm sick of this! I'm going!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.520
No, I'm going!

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.930
Stop! You can't!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.490
Outta the way!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:43.550
Please get out of the way, Kiriko-san!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:01.410
Stupid Seina-chan!

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.190
A wealthy daughter and a princess...

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.260
We're not with Ryoko-sama anymore...

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.260
No warm, erotic welcoming...

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:48.630
And NB ran off...

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:51.030
We have no luck at all...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.770
These are the new operators assigned to our ship.

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.000
Treat them well!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.740
I'm Alan.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.210
I'm Cohen.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.680
I'm Barry.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.750
I'm Naoko! Nice to meet you!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.190
Yes!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.460
A thank-you gift?

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:24.900
But we're indebted to you, we can't really accept anything more...

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:28.090
It's all right. I was only asked to pass it on to you.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.070
Seto-sama! What is this...?!

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:40.250
With the Kamidake as it is, you will need a replacement ship, will you not?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.520
You can name it whatever you like.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.790
It's Professor Washu's very latest battleship.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.390
Professor Washu's?!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.960
Can we accept this?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:55.260
But in return we have a favor to ask of you.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:00.890
Neige-chan...

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:16.080
We would like you to transport this girl to a certain location.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:20.320
It is a dangerous mission, but I am sure that with this ship, you can do it!

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.990
I ask this of you, Seina-dono!

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:25.090
It's nice to meet you, Big Brother Seina!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.430
Likewise!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.860
I'm so happy that I can go on a trip with you, Big Brother!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:33.490
It might not be a very good trip, though...

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.440
How dare they leave me all alone and have an erotic party without me?!

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:48.510
Ah well. I'll show you Juraian girls what a real man's like!

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:51.350
You have no idea just how intense...

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.410
What's that?

00:21:57.760 --> 00:21:59.250
Stay away! Stay away!

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:04.250
No! They got me again! If this keeps up...!

